1:36.01,0:01:40.75,Kanji,text lead-in,0,0,0,template,!retime("start2syl",-500+syl.i*40,0)!Comment: 1,0:01:36.01,0:01:40.75,Kanji Gray,text lead-in,0,0,0,template,!retime("start2syl",-500+syl.i*40,0)!Comment: 1,0:01:36.01,0:01:40.75,Kanji - Copy - Copy,text lead-in,0,0,0,template,!retime("start2syl",-0+syl.i*0,0)!Comment: 1,0:01:36.01,0:01:40.75,Kanji,text lead-in,0,0,0,template furi,!retime("start2syl",-500+syl.i*40,0)!Comment: 1,0:01:36.01,0:01:40.75,Kanji Gray,text lead-in,0,0,0,template furi,!retime("start2syl",-500+syl.i*40,0)!Comment: 1,0:01:36.01,0:01:40.75,Kanji - Copy - Copy,text lead-in,0,0,0,template furi,!retime("start2syl",-0+syl.i*0,0)!Comment: 0,0:01:39.15,0:01:42.65,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Kagirinaki CHIKARA umareruComment: 0,0:01:39.15,0:01:42.65,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,限｜か#｜ぎりなきチカラ生｜うまれるComment: 0,0:01:39.15,0:01:42.65,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Limitless power surgesComment: 0,0:01:42.65,0:01:45.86,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Motomeru naraba dokomademoComment: 0,0:01:42.65,0:01:45.86,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,求｜も#｜とめるならば　どこまでもComment: 0,0:01:42.65,0:01:45.86,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,As long as you wish,Comment: 0,0:01:45.86,0:01:48.43,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Kawaranu KIZUNA furikazasouComment: 0,0:01:45.86,0:01:48.43,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,変｜かわらぬキズナ振｜ふりかざそうComment: 0,0:01:45.86,0:01:48.43,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,We'll brandish our unchanging bondComment: 0,0:01:48.39,0:01:49.86,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,We are hopeComment: 0,0:01:55.87,0:02:02.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Kimi to honki de kokoro butsukeatta yorokobi moComment: 0,0:01:55.87,0:02:02.74,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,君｜き#｜みと本｜ほん気｜！きで心｜＜こ#｜こ#｜ろぶつけ슴｜あった喜｜＜よ#｜ろ#｜こびもComment: 0,0:01:55.87,0:02:02.74,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,The joy of letting our true feelings fly at each otherComment: 0,0:02:02.74,0:02:10.05,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Warai korogete NAMIDA kawakashita setsunasa moComment: 0,0:02:02.74,0:02:10.05,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,笑｜わ#｜らい転｜こ#｜ろげてナミダ乾｜か#｜わかした切｜せ#｜つなさもComment: 0,0:02:02.74,0:02:10.05,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,The pain from how we laughed our heads off to dry our tearsComment: 0,0:02:10.05,0:02:16.89,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Tsunagi awasete kaze no naka AhComment: 0,0:02:10.05,0:02:16.89,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,繋｜つ#｜なぎあわせて風｜か#｜ぜの中｜な#｜か　あぁComment: 0,0:02:10.05,0:02:16.89,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,We connect them together and in the wind AhComment: 0,0:02:16.89,0:02:23.66,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Hatameiteiru yo takaku takakuComment: 0,0:02:16.89,0:02:23.66,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,はためいているよ　高｜た#｜かく　高｜た#｜かくComment: 0,0:02:16.89,0:02:23.66,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's fluttering higher and higherComment: 0,0:02:23.66,0:02:26.83,Karaoke Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Why sagasu koto wo akirameta noComment: 0,0:02:23.66,0:02:26.83,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Why　探｜さ#｜がすことを諦｜＜あ#｜き#｜らめたのComment: 0,0:02:23.66,0:02:26.83,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Why did you give up on your search?Comment: 0,0:02:26.83,0:02:30.24,Karaoke Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Why hitori tatakai tsuzukeru noComment: 0,0:02:26.83,0:02:30.24,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Why　独｜ひ#｜とり闘｜＜た#｜た#｜かい続｜つ#｜づけるのComment: 0,0:02:26.83,0:02:30.24,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Why do you keep fighting by yourself?Comment: 0,0:02:30.24,0:02:33.14,Karaoke Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Nee donna mirai kakugo shita noComment: 0,0:02:30.24,0:02:33.14,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,ねえ　どんな未｜み来｜！ら#｜い　覚｜か#｜く悟｜！ごしたのComment: 0,0:02:30.24,0:02:33.14,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Say, what kind of future did you prepare for?Comment: 0,0:02:33.14,0:02:36.84,Karaoke Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Yume wa mou te ni shita noComment: 0,0:02:33.14,0:02:36.84,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,夢｜ゆ#｜めはもう手｜てにしたのComment: 0,0:02:33.14,0:02:36.84,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Have you fulfilled your dream?Comment: 0,0:02:37.04,0:02:40.91,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Me wo tojite mimi wo sumashiteComment: 0,0:02:37.04,0:02:40.91,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,目｜めを閉｜とじて耳｜み#｜みを澄｜すましてComment: 0,0:02:37.04,0:02:40.91,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Close your eyes and listen carefullyComment: 0,0:02:40.91,0:02:44.35,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Sagashi dasou kimi no kotae woComment: 0,0:02:40.91,0:02:44.35,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,探｜さ#｜がし出｜だそう　君｜き#｜みの答｜こ#｜たえをComment: 0,0:02:40.91,0:02:44.35,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Let's look for your answerComment: 0,0:02:44.35,0:02:47.55,Karaoke Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Michi wa kanarazu tsuzuiteiru yoComment: 0,0:02:44.35,0:02:47.55,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,道｜み#｜ちは必｜＜か#｜な#｜らず　続｜つ#｜づいているよComment: 0,0:02:44.35,0:02:47.55,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,The road always continues towards the seaComment: 0,0:02:47.55,0:02:50.09,Karaoke Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Mada mitakoto no nai umi heComment: 0,0:02:47.55,0:02:50.09,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,まだ見｜みたことのない海｜う#｜みへComment: 0,0:02:47.55,0:02:50.09,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,That you've never seenComment: 0,0:02:49.18,0:02:50.09,Karaoke - Copy - Copy,,0,0,0,karaoke,umi heComment: 0,0:02:49.18,0:02:50.09,Kanji - Copy - Copy,,0,0,0,karaoke,海｜う#｜みへComment: 0,0:02:50.09,0:02:51.36,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,We are hopeComment: 0,0:02:51.36,0:02:54.73,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Aoku hiroi sekai no hate niComment: 0,0:02:51.36,0:02:54.73,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,青｜あ#｜おく広｜ひ#｜ろい世｜せ界｜！か#｜いの果｜はてにComment: 0,0:02:51.36,0:02:54.73,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,At the broad, blue end of the worldComment: 0,0:02:54.73,0:02:57.23,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Kimi to kaeru beki basho ga aruComment: 0,0:02:54.73,0:02:57.23,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,君｜き#｜みと還｜か#｜えるべき場｜ば所｜！しょがあるComment: 0,0:02:54.73,0:02:57.23,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,There is a place I have to return to with youComment: 0,0:02:57.23,0:03:00.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Boku tachi wa eien niComment: 0,0:02:57.23,0:03:00.03,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,僕｜ぼ#｜くたちは永｜え#｜い遠｜！えんにComment: 0,0:02:57.23,0:03:00.03,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,We will be foreverComment: 0,0:03:00.03,0:03:06.77,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Tooi mukashi sou kimeteitaComment: 0,0:03:00.03,0:03:06.77,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,遠｜とおい昔｜＜む#｜か#｜し　そう決｜きめていたComment: 0,0:03:00.03,0:03:06.77,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,decided long ago in the pastComment: 0,0:03:17.42,0:03:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Comment: 0,0:03:50.42,0:03:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.78,0:00:06.96,Captions,,0,0,0,,About Three and a Half Hours Ago Bege's HideoutDialogue: 0,0:00:07.18,0:00:10.40,Main,,0,0,0,,A mirror inside the wedding cake?Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.40,0:00:14.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! If you can put a mirror inside of it,Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.21,0:00:17.71,Main,,0,0,0,,We can bust out,  straight from mirror dimension!Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.71,0:00:21.09,Main,,0,0,0,,It'll be be fun and sweet!Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.74,0:00:24.39,Main,,0,0,0,,You're not here to have fun!Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.39,0:00:27.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't make me repeat myself! Your job is...Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.24,0:00:30.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I know! You want me to break the picture, right?Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.68,0:00:35.08,Main,,0,0,0,,But it won't hurt to have fun while doing it!Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.89,0:00:38.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous!Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.40,0:00:40.87,Main,,0,0,0,,You want to destroy the wedding cake?Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.87,0:00:45.39,Main,,0,0,0,,You have no idea how much Mama's been looking forward to it...Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.39,0:00:48.39,Main,,0,0,0,,You made the copies of Nami and the others in the woods, right?Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.39,0:00:49.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.07,0:00:49.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.96,0:00:52.80,Main,,0,0,0,,She can make copies of a person,Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:56.16,Main,,0,0,0,,and project them onto other animals!Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.42,0:01:06.54,Main,,0,0,0,,So what?!Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.06,0:01:14.05,Main,,0,0,0,,I caught them... Make them look like me.Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.05,0:01:15.48,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.87,0:01:17.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Father!Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.58,0:01:19.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, you all done?Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.48,0:01:22.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Everything is ready-rero.Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.00,0:01:23.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay. Good job.Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.69,0:01:31.42,Main,,0,0,0,,It's on now...Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.37,0:03:13.88,Captions,,0,0,0,,In the Present – The Wedding VenueDialogue: 0,0:03:13.88,0:03:18.55,Main,,0,0,0,,P-People are coming out of the cake!Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.47,0:03:25.44,Title,,0,0,0,,The HonorableDialogue: 0,0:03:35.87,0:03:38.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh my! I can't believe it!Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.66,0:03:43.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Another flashy show-nen...Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.14,0:03:47.28,Main,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it, Du Feld. This is big news!Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.28,0:03:50.53,Main,,0,0,0,,He's a pirate from the Worst Generation!Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.16,0:03:53.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.62,0:03:56.26,Main,,0,0,0,,The unimaginable is happening!Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.26,0:03:58.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Why is he here?Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.50,0:04:02.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Are they all Straw Hat?Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.83,0:04:04.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are there so many of him?Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.54,0:04:09.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Run! The cake is collapsing!Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.70,0:04:12.18,Main,,0,0,0,,What are they?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.64,0:04:18.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.73,0:04:26.32,Main,,0,0,0,,That bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.49,0:04:32.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding-chan, calm down!Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.79,0:04:38.89,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,It's finally started... This is all going to be decided in an instant.Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.89,0:04:40.62,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.94,0:04:46.34,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on, Mont d'or?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.34,0:04:51.27,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought Straw Hat Luffy and the girl died in the Prison Library!Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.18,0:04:53.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.35,0:04:57.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Opera, that dumbass... He really was lying!Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.23,0:05:01.03,Main,,0,0,0,,He was trying to cover his own ass!Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.28,0:05:11.08,Main,,0,0,0,,My...Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.08,0:05:13.04,Main,,0,0,0,,precious...Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.04,0:05:15.29,Main,,0,0,0,,cake is...Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.29,0:05:18.65,Main,,0,0,0,,The cake is...Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.22,0:05:23.39,Main,,0,0,0,,What the...?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.82,0:05:25.59,Main,,0,0,0,,She's acting weird...Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.29,0:05:30.80,Main,,0,0,0,,No... I was looking forward to that...Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.52,0:05:35.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama, please keep your composure! I know how you're feeling.Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.23,0:05:45.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Cake!Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.20,0:05:49.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Head chef! Run for it!Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.16,0:05:51.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama's acting strange!Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.71,0:05:57.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Bring me a new cake...Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.80,0:06:00.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-That's impossible...Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.04,0:06:03.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Life...Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.98,0:06:05.45,Main,,0,0,0,,or...Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.45,0:06:08.43,Main,,0,0,0,,wedding cake?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.62,0:06:13.79,Main,,0,0,0,,G-Guys...Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.68,0:06:16.37,Main,,0,0,0,,It's her Soul Pocus!Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.37,0:06:19.31,Main,,0,0,0,,She's going to take their lifespans! What a scoop!Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.09,0:06:24.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Mom can speak directly to the human soul's fixation on its own life!Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.78,0:06:28.49,Main,,0,0,0,,If a person fears death at all, they'll be vulnerable to it...Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.49,0:06:30.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Look! That's it!Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.39,0:06:36.96,Main,,0,0,0,,H... H-Help!Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.74,0:06:39.98,Main,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.45,0:06:49.43,Main,,0,0,0,,If you don't give me what I want...Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.43,0:06:53.26,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll take your lifespan to make up for it!Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.47,0:07:01.15,Captions,,0,0,170,,Mirro-worldDialogue: 0,0:07:02.00,0:07:03.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Go! Go!Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.40,0:07:04.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, that way!Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.78,0:07:12.07,Main,,0,0,0,,That voice... It sounds like Big Mom's throwing a fit out there!Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.07,0:07:14.41,Main,,0,0,0,,We're pretty desperate in here too!Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.41,0:07:17.41,Main,,0,0,0,,The situation is messier than we expected it to be!Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.41,0:07:20.19,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll make you pay for this!Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.00,0:07:23.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that all of them?Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.08,0:07:24.88,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the last Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.12,0:07:29.17,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! Let's go, Pedro!Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.17,0:07:31.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Let's give Luffy some backup!Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.02,0:07:38.98,Main,,0,0,0,,We're going too! To back up Sanji-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.38,0:07:40.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.32,0:07:42.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! I've got my earplugs!Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.60,0:07:44.73,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll rescue Sanji's family!Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.74,0:07:49.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, we'll leave the rest to you, human scum.Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.28,0:07:52.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Is he really that bad?Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.42,0:07:54.16,Main,,0,0,0,,He's the worst!Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.26,0:08:07.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Once I get my heart back, I'll teach them a lesson...Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.49,0:08:17.82,Main,,0,0,0,,That bastard, Straw Hat...Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.82,0:08:20.06,Main,,0,0,0,,How dare he mess with me!Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.00,0:08:28.10,Main,,0,0,0,,You asshole!Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.98,0:08:32.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Which one is the real Straw Hat?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.18,0:08:38.74,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Monkey D. Luffy...Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.74,0:08:42.25,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'll remember that name.Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.25,0:08:45.42,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Come! To the New World!Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.34,0:08:51.84,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,What a stupid story...Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.84,0:08:54.80,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You're the one who hasn't become...Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.80,0:08:56.47,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,the King of the Pirates.Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.58,0:09:01.30,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm here to pick another fight with you!Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.31,0:09:04.85,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Don't be cocky just because you're an Emperor!Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.85,0:09:07.31,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take Sanji back!Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.31,0:09:11.42,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,We're the ones who'll win!Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.06,0:09:22.02,Main,,0,0,0,,The cake has... collapsed...Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.78,0:09:34.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit...Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.95,0:09:38.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit...Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.35,0:09:45.94,Main,,0,0,0,,How dare he ruin my wedding cake!Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.05,0:09:53.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Which one's the real Straw Hat Luffy?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.52,0:09:57.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Where is he?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.57,0:10:02.41,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,What an idiot. This is just a diversion.Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.41,0:10:06.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Show yourself! Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.08,0:10:08.97,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Does she really expect him to reveal himself?Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.97,0:10:11.46,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I mean, if he responds...Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.70,0:10:26.07,Main,,0,0,0,,It's me!Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.38,0:10:31.40,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,He... He responded!Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.22,0:10:35.90,Main,,0,0,0,,There you are, Straw Hat...Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.90,0:10:38.70,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll crush you!Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.67,0:10:57.30,Main,,0,0,0,,There's the picture frame!Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.68,0:11:09.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Vito... Gotti... Is the Launcher ready?Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.28,0:11:16.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can jump out anytime, Father.Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.44,0:11:20.40,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat... Do your best.Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.78,0:11:22.43,Main,,0,0,0,,No, let go of me!Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.43,0:11:24.88,Main,,0,0,0,,The flock keeps coming!Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.74,0:11:30.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Come on!Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.39,0:11:37.00,Main,,0,0,0,,That must be the real Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.32,0:11:39.53,Captions,,0,0,0,,Inside the CakeDialogue: 0,0:11:37.00,0:11:40.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Once Luffy breaks the picture, we'll burst in after three seconds...Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.58,0:11:41.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh...Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.97,0:11:44.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you listening? Be serious!Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.10,0:11:46.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh...Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.80,0:11:50.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Zeus!Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.18,0:11:51.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.52,0:11:52.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Prometheus!Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.95,0:11:54.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.40,0:11:56.90,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll take them all out at once!Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.78,0:12:00.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.49,0:12:04.57,Main,,0,0,0,,This'll be easy!Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.57,0:12:06.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Take this!Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.83,0:12:08.12,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,He can do it!Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.12,0:12:10.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.96,0:12:15.10,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.54,0:12:19.38,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the real one!Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.38,0:12:22.54,Main,,0,0,0,,The other Straw Hats are...Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.54,0:12:28.56,Main,,0,0,0,,just animals from the island, that were transformed by Brûlée's ability.Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.56,0:12:30.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Ignore them!Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.08,0:12:33.23,Main,,0,0,0,,I see! So they used Brûlée's ability!Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.23,0:12:35.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn...Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.06,0:12:38.77,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.77,0:12:42.48,Main,,0,0,0,,My limbs are buried and I can't pull them out! What kind of ability is this?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.48,0:12:47.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Katakuri! You think I need help? You're my son, I don't need...Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.25,0:12:49.38,Main,,0,0,0,,No, Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.70,0:12:52.08,Main,,0,0,0,,He was targeting...Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.04,0:12:59.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Mother Carmel's portrait.Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.34,0:13:05.58,Main,,0,0,0,,How do you know its importance to us?Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.58,0:13:08.44,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought only our allies knew.Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.30,0:13:12.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Spit it out! Who told you?Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.37,0:13:14.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Let go of me, you idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.85,0:13:17.60,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Damn... The plan's in ruins.Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.60,0:13:20.32,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Somebody! Just break the picture!Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.97,0:13:30.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.95,0:13:32.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn.Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.39,0:13:33.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll handle it, Pedro!Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.52,0:13:39.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Ocean Current...Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.56,0:13:42.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Shoulder Throw!Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.67,0:13:45.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Run!Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.27,0:14:03.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't explain my powers to them...Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.69,0:14:05.31,Main,,0,0,0,,That was close...Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.31,0:14:08.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Katakuri ate a special Paramecia fruit.Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.95,0:14:11.63,Main,,0,0,0,,The Mochi-Mochi Fruit.Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.63,0:14:12.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.45,0:14:17.32,Main,,0,0,0,,You can escape if there's enough moisture, but try not to touch it instead.Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.70,0:14:18.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe?Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.96,0:14:24.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who told Luffy about Mother Carmel.Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.00,0:14:28.24,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard all about it, while I was working under you.Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.13,0:14:36.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Those idiots! How dare they interfere...Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.02,0:14:40.00,Main,,0,0,0,,To come this far to take Sanji back!Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.00,0:14:42.27,Main,,0,0,0,,The wedding has been ruined...Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.27,0:14:45.26,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought that silly Straw Hat was dead...Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.26,0:14:49.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Vinsmokes.Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.15,0:14:53.41,Main,,0,0,0,,The Charlotte Family will handle this...Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.74,0:14:55.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Lick!Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.62,0:15:00.34,Main,,0,0,0,,You...Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.34,0:15:04.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought you decided not to leave my crew...Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.04,0:15:08.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Yet now you're sticking up for this cake wrecker?Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.74,0:15:14.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Shall I take this as a rebellion?Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.55,0:15:16.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe?Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.09,0:15:18.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's exactly what this is.Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.67,0:15:22.66,Main,,0,0,0,,You have some nerve...Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.81,0:15:27.36,Main,,0,0,0,,I wish to end our agreement and...Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.57,0:15:35.28,Main,,0,0,0,,join the Straw Hat Pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.99,0:15:37.99,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.12,0:15:44.46,Main,,0,0,0,,This is big news!Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.46,0:15:48.30,Main,,0,0,0,,The former Warlord Jinbe is joining the Straw Hat Crew!Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.96,0:15:55.39,Main,,0,0,0,,That's okay... You can do whatever you want.Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.72,0:16:01.34,Main,,0,0,0,,But first you have to pay the price to leave.Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.34,0:16:05.27,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't want to live in shame, do you?Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.27,0:16:06.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Right...Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.68,0:16:11.11,Main,,0,0,0,,If you promise that you won't hurt anyone else,Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.11,0:16:15.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll happily give you as much  of my lifespan as you can take!Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.16,0:16:20.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you talking about, Jinbe?! You can't join my crew if you're dead!Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.70,0:16:24.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I love to take people's lifespans!Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.55,0:16:29.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I see... I never realized you hated me so much.Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.66,0:16:35.43,Main,,0,0,0,,You'd rather choose death than stay somewhere you don't want to be...Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.43,0:16:37.70,Main,,0,0,0,,So I won't show any mercy!Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.93,0:16:43.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh... Here it is again! The Soul Pocus!Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.35,0:16:47.86,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! You've got a deal!Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.15,0:16:53.24,Main,,0,0,0,,You fool...Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.65,0:16:56.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay...Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.33,0:17:04.12,Main,,0,0,0,,or...Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.12,0:17:06.59,Main,,0,0,0,,life?Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.83,0:17:11.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Life!Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.13,0:17:13.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama...Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.45,0:17:15.92,Main,,0,0,0,,It... can't be stopped now...Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.92,0:17:18.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Is Jinbe really going to die here...?Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.80,0:17:21.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Go to hell...Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.15,0:17:41.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay or...Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.80,0:17:43.45,Main,,0,0,0,,life!Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.16,0:17:51.07,Main,,0,0,0,,H-His soul isn't coming out of his body!Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.07,0:17:55.26,Main,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me... He's showing no fear in front of Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.92,0:18:00.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course not.Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.47,0:18:05.23,Main,,0,0,0,,I intend to join the crew of the future Pirate King...Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.27,0:18:11.94,Main,,0,0,0,,A mere Emperor  does not scare me!Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.45,0:18:20.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama... can't take his lifespan?Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.03,0:18:33.34,Main,,0,0,0,,If you will not take my life...Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.28,0:18:37.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Then I shall return your ritual sake cup.Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.21,0:18:54.07,Main,,0,0,0,,As of this moment, I am leaving the Big Mom Pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.40,0:18:58.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you for all you've done!Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.49,0:19:09.22,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he's doing it right now...Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.22,0:19:12.28,Main,,0,0,0,,So cool... Jinbe...Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.88,0:19:17.60,Main,,0,0,0,,All right!Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.10,0:19:36.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Jinbe...Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.01,0:19:43.36,Main,,0,0,0,,But this means you're my enemy now, right?Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.48,0:19:46.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.50,0:19:48.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Go to hell!Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.49,0:20:07.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Look! Over there!Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.56,0:20:17.02,Main,,0,0,0,,H-He broke the... portrait of Mother Carmel!Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.24,0:20:29.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! This is a big deal!Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.25,0:20:31.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama...Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.03,0:20:35.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes!Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.76,0:20:38.00,Main,,0,0,0,,All right!Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.00,0:20:39.41,Main,,0,0,0,,It's broken!Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.34,0:20:45.46,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell?! I thought the fake Straw Hats were all animals!Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.90,0:20:58.78,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Okay! Big Mom has seen the broken picture!Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.78,0:21:01.77,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Now, if she just shrieks...Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.36,0:21:10.52,Main,,0,0,0,,What is he doing?Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.37,0:21:19.49,Main,,0,0,0,,This deadly poison KX Launcher is ready to fire-rero!Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.32,0:21:30.56,Main,,0,0,0,,He ripped off his face!Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.56,0:21:33.28,Main,,0,0,0,,No! This is my real face!Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.28,0:21:35.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Gross!Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.12,0:21:35.90,Main,,0,0,0,,What...?Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.90,0:21:39.68,Main,,0,0,0,,S-Soul King?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.49,0:21:43.70,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought that you were dead!Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.70,0:21:47.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I am... But that happened a long time ago.Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.96,0:21:50.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you know...Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.78,0:21:53.74,Main,,0,0,0,,who that is...Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.37,0:22:01.34,Main,,0,0,0,,in that picture...?Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.87,0:22:04.29,Main,,0,0,0,,M-Mother...Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.20,0:22:08.00,Main,,0,0,0,,W-Why isn't she shrieking?Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.09,0:22:15.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! It's just like the other day! Mama's gonna go on a rampage!Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.13,0:22:20.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea who that is?Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.84,0:22:27.48,Main,,0,0,0,,And the wedding cake!Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.19,0:22:33.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, so that's it!Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.78,0:22:38.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama's not thinking straight! She's gonna have a tantrum!Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.53,0:22:41.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Kill Straw Hat and the others before that happens!Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.70,0:22:43.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.90,0:22:47.59,Main,,0,0,0,,We have to survive until Big Mom panics!Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.59,0:22:48.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.38,0:22:50.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.67,0:22:57.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Help!Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.66,0:23:01.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Get off of me!Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.36,0:23:12.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Pudding-chan?Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.31,0:23:14.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's get you somewhere safe.Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.31,0:23:43.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop, Pudding-chan!Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.97,0:23:45.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.60,0:23:50.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Look! This is who I truly am!Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.19,0:23:54.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Aren't you shocked and disappointed?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.83,0:23:57.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.06,0:23:59.37,Main,,0,0,0,,You'll be dead soon!Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.30,0:24:20.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I've fooled many people like this!Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.71,0:24:22.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Including yourself?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.65,0:24:29.63,Main,,0,0,0,,You've been fooling yourself, haven't you, Pudding-chan?Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.88,0:24:34.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Sh... Shut up!Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.20,0:24:36.62,Main,,0,0,0,,An idiot like you can't...Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.80,0:24:44.63,Main,,0,0,0,,An idiot like you can't...Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.70,0:24:47.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Move aside, Pudding!Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.36,0:24:59.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding-chan!Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.67,0:25:10.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Pudding-chan?Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.53,0:25:14.34,Main,,0,0,0,,You blew it! You're useless!Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.34,0:25:16.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Brother Daifuku!Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.69,0:25:22.45,Captions,,0,0,0,,Charlotte Daifuku Third Son of the Charlotte Family (Minister of Beans) A Puff-Puff Fruit Eater and a Lamp-manDialogue: 0,0:25:17.29,0:25:22.95,Main,,0,0,0,,We needed you to kill the groom.Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.74,0:25:28.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.57,0:25:35.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Go, Genie!Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.20,0:25:42.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Geniiie!Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.10,0:25:50.40,Main,,0,0,0,,What's that?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.94,0:25:54.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Brother Daifuku!Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.74,0:25:58.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait! I promise I'll get it done!Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.23,0:26:05.83,Main,,0,0,0,,You couldn't do it then... You won't do it now!Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.66,0:26:11.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding-chan!Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.94,0:26:20.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Genie-uine Rage Hunt!Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.92,0:26:24.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Collier Strike!Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.89,0:26:36.86,Captions,,0,0,0,,Mirro-worldDialogue: 0,0:26:37.60,0:26:40.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop!Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.36,0:26:44.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't abuse my powers anymore!Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.07,0:26:48.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up! My heart is at stake!Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.04,0:26:56.44,Main,,0,0,0,,These guys just won't stop.Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.11,0:27:01.35,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Bege?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.35,0:27:06.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Be quiet! I'm the head of security! They'll suspect me if I do nothing!Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.89,0:27:08.90,Main,,0,0,0,,I got the captain!Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.90,0:27:11.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright! Kill him!Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.79,0:27:16.02,Main,,0,0,0,,That might not be a bad idea.Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.02,0:27:17.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Screw you!Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.71,0:27:21.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen! We're in trouble.Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.84,0:27:25.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Why isn't Big Mom shrieking?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.81,0:27:29.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't fight this many!Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.66,0:27:33.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.92,0:27:35.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Oven!Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.94,0:27:39.30,Main,,0,0,0,,You bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.30,0:27:43.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pedro! Don't let him land any hits on you!Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.59,0:27:50.16,Main,,0,0,0,,What the?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.77,0:27:59.11,Captions,,0,0,0,,Charlotte Oven Fourth Son of the Charlotte Family (Minister of Browned Food) A Heat-Heat Fruit Eater and an Intense Heat HumanDialogue: 0,0:27:55.74,0:27:59.11,Main,,0,0,0,,I remember you, Pedro!Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.11,0:28:02.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Pekoms calls you his big brother.Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.97,0:28:07.85,Main,,0,0,0,,You failed to steal Mama's Poneglyph.Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.85,0:28:11.41,Main,,0,0,0,,You lost an eye and years of your lifespan as a result.Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.69,0:28:16.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Yet you've returned here, despite the limited time you have left...Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.40,0:28:18.95,Main,,0,0,0,,So you're prepared to die, right?Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.91,0:28:28.94,Main,,0,0,0,,I've always been prepared!Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.00,0:28:32.44,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll burn you to death!Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.72,0:28:36.73,Main,,0,0,0,,It's been way longer than three seconds!Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.32,0:28:39.50,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on?Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.50,0:28:42.20,Main,,0,0,0,,She's not shrieking at all!Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.35,0:28:56.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Brook!Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.38,0:29:01.87,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm okay. I'm alive. I mean, I'm dead...Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.58,0:29:05.56,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you could do that!Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.01,0:29:10.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, listen to me, Luffy-san!Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.70,0:29:13.94,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.94,0:29:18.90,Main,,0,0,0,,How could you do this to us!Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.90,0:29:21.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Bege, get off of me!Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.15,0:29:25.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn! This wasn't supposed to happen.Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.41,0:29:29.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Tell me this is a mistake!Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.14,0:29:31.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Mom!Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.50,0:29:37.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Lick.Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.32,0:29:44.62,Main,,0,0,0,,I trusted you! Even the underworld is ruled by honor and decency!Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.95,0:29:47.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Say something!Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.06,0:29:54.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be pathetic, father.Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.64,0:29:56.50,Main,,0,0,0,,It's already too late for us.Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.08,0:29:59.39,Main,,0,0,0,,We're trapped by this candy.Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.18,0:30:04.66,Main,,0,0,0,,And they already took all of our weapons. We don't even have our Raid Suits.Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.66,0:30:09.46,Main,,0,0,0,,We've been totally set up. I guess we were too ambitious.Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.40,0:30:16.58,Main,,0,0,0,,What's so funny, you fools?!Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.24,0:30:24.24,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,The one who removed all empathy from your sons was you...Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.46,0:30:26.08,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Father-sama.Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.00,0:30:29.98,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,They don't even fear their own deaths...Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.73,0:30:35.37,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,They're my younger brothers, but even I can't call them human.Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.94,0:30:43.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy. I've never seen such a pathetic assassination!Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.90,0:30:48.12,Main,,0,0,0,,This feels more more like  a cruel execution. Lick.Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.74,0:30:53.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you agree, Judge?Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.48,0:30:58.56,Main,,0,0,0,,I have... devoted my whole life...Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.56,0:31:00.79,Main,,0,0,0,,My very existence...!Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.79,0:31:04.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Towards getting revenge on the countries in the North Blue!Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.90,0:31:09.36,Main,,0,0,0,,To restore the Germa Empire!Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.36,0:31:11.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Mom!Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.89,0:31:16.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Say something, Big Mom!!Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.71,0:31:23.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Look at yourself!Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.40,0:31:27.00,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Germa's gonna get wiped out?Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.00,0:31:30.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! This is big news!Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.85,0:31:41.11,Main,,0,0,0,,He's crying!Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.94,0:31:48.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Tell me... it's not true!Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.80,0:31:52.43,Main,,0,0,0,,It's no use. Look at Mama.Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.89,0:31:57.41,Main,,0,0,0,,– She's dazed by these shocking events.Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.89,0:31:57.41,Secondary,,0,0,0,,– Mother... Cake...Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.15,0:32:03.16,Main,,0,0,0,,It made me a little nervous when the portrait of Mother Carmel was broken,Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.16,0:32:09.66,Main,,0,0,0,,but the intensity of her anger has overwhelmed her grief, so we're okay.Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.15,0:32:15.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I truly understand your burning ambition, Judge...Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.79,0:32:17.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Lick.Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.58,0:32:24.52,Main,,0,0,0,,But do you listen to what a cow has to say when you're about to eat it?Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.33,0:32:33.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Your death will nourish us, Germa 66!Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.95,0:32:36.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji's family...Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.77,0:32:39.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san, listen to me!Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.67,0:32:43.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Mom has experienced too many shocks in quick succession,Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.36,0:32:46.92,Main,,0,0,0,,so she doesn't know how to focus her anger.Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.92,0:32:51.07,Main,,0,0,0,,We should show her the broken portrait again!Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.07,0:32:54.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay! I'll do it if you think it's best!Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.32,0:32:56.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, isn't it too late...?Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.44,0:33:01.79,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.70,0:33:04.95,Main,,0,0,0,,That guy from earlier is coming!Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.28,0:33:09.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Katakuri!Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.40,0:33:14.98,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! Carry on! That plan will work!Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.47,0:33:18.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Katakuri is looking pale!Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.59,0:33:23.06,Main,,0,0,0,,That means he's seen the future where things get messy.Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.46,0:33:25.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Go, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.24,0:33:26.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.44,0:33:29.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe! Pedro!Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.36,0:33:32.85,Main,,0,0,0,,We gotta back Straw Hat up with all we've got! Follow me!Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.47,0:33:42.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Allied forces!Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.79,0:33:48.19,Main,,0,0,0,,All of you, get your Invisible Symphonia ready!Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.19,0:33:49.81,Main,,0,0,0,,– Invi... – Oh!Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.81,0:33:51.20,Main,,0,0,0,,The earplugs!Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.20,0:33:52.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Bege?Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.56,0:33:55.50,Main,,0,0,0,,What did he yell out all of a sudden?!Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.23,0:33:58.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Can you make it?!Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.77,0:34:03.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Will it work in time?! Our only chance is to neutralize everyone with a gun all at once!Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.32,0:34:08.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Bege!Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.19,0:34:16.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Shoot Straw Hat to death now!Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.47,0:34:21.61,Main,,0,0,0,,I refuse.Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.42,0:34:36.61,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! If I show this to Big Mom again, the plan's back on track, right?Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.68,0:34:50.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Flambage Shot!Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.55,0:35:06.49,Main,,0,0,0,,You can see slightly ahead into future.Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.52,0:35:10.95,Main,,0,0,0,,But even if we can't see it,Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.46,0:35:14.41,Main,,0,0,0,,we all have the right...Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.88,0:35:18.69,Main,,0,0,0,,to change the future!Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.28,0:35:27.80,Main,,0,0,0,,S... traw... Ha... t...Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.90,0:35:35.89,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Feeso, Galaxy 9000  Timing: Lance  Quality Assurance: Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Grug, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Infoboxes & Title:  Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: CrunchyrollDialogue: 2,0:01:35.51,0:01:35.81,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.01,0:01:35.51,Kar